{"4562850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Fell for Her", "steam_appid": 4562850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/f53b9bc21a7118508fb4baee6e4d8727.avif?t=1777545110\" width=524 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vito, a 22-year-old young man who lives a quiet life with his grandmother after losing his parents at a young age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless job applications with no response, Vito decides to follow in his late father’s footsteps by renting a small shop and opening his own barbershop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things start to feel different when he notices a woman working in the shop next door. She’s kind, charming… and somehow hard to ignore. Before long, Vito finds himself wanting to get closer to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/adfd296b2aaf63e949d757657b25f066.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/adfd296b2aaf63e949d757657b25f066.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/adfd296b2aaf63e949d757657b25f066.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day… her shop doesn’t open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No explanation. No goodbye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something isn’t right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did she go? <br><strong>And what is she hiding?.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/79b3701cd9f01d6cf87fefdeacd6e106.avif?t=1777545110\" width=524 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut the hair of several unique customers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/03592e4a952d8c76d54cea60b98e9d3e.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/03592e4a952d8c76d54cea60b98e9d3e.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/03592e4a952d8c76d54cea60b98e9d3e.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random haircuts are available for customers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make customers' wishes come true.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/8edc610027752c0ff06e3561e1e96804.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/8edc610027752c0ff06e3561e1e96804.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/8edc610027752c0ff06e3561e1e96804.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean up customer hair that fell on the floor.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/23497701e7d6066b650bcc7776a60af8.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/23497701e7d6066b650bcc7776a60af8.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/23497701e7d6066b650bcc7776a60af8.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Horror Experience</strong> – Immerse yourself in a horror atmosphere with <strong>PS1-style graphics</strong> and <strong>pixel art visuals</strong> that enhance the eerie feeling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Works as a barber</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological</strong> horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the Camera style to normal or pixel style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will save automatically if you have changed scenes and you can continue the menu.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/f53b9bc21a7118508fb4baee6e4d8727.avif?t=1777545110\" width=524 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vito, a 22-year-old young man who lives a quiet life with his grandmother after losing his parents at a young age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After countless job applications with no response, Vito decides to follow in his late father’s footsteps by renting a small shop and opening his own barbershop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.poster.avif?t=1777545110\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.webm?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4562850/extras/d19d8a407ea2d872a4e88a2e6a10f25e.mp4?t=1777545110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things start to feel different when he notices a woman working in the shop next door. She’s kind, charming… and somehow hard to ignore. Before long, Vito finds himself wanting to get closer to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass